   {% math
      expression="\\begin{aligned} H(\\omega) & =\\frac{R}{R_1+1 / j \\omega C_1} \\\\ & =\\frac{j \\omega / \\omega_{\\mathrm{c}}}{1+j \\omega / \\omega_{\\mathrm{c}}} \\\\ & \\simeq\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc}\\left(j \\omega / \\omega_{\\mathrm{c}}\\right) & \\omega \\ll \\omega_{\\mathrm{c}} \\\\ 1 & \\omega \\gg \\omega_{\\mathrm{c}}\\end{array}\\right.\\end{aligned}" /%}

1. 零状态相应方程：与低通滤波器相同

